Copyright Apple Computer, Inc.  All rights reserved.

This program is a Mac program, stored in MacBinary format.  Transfer it to
your Macintosh disk with Mac-2-Dos using the MacBinary conversion option.

To use this program on the Mac:
	1. Transfer ResEdit to a Mac disk using Mac-2-Dos (MacBinary option)
	2. Load the Mac disk into a Macintosh
	3. Double-click on the ResEdit icon
	4. Select Open on the File menu
	5. Select the desired file from those displayed in the 
	   dialog-box (requester)

This program is provided only as a convenience for Mac-2-Dos users. 
Central Coast Software did not write this program, is not responsible for
its use, and cannot provide support for it.

